    },
    {
      "id": "ab25c091e8ed255d2cb62550d9d84a6f613469e06b3ce80752292d1a5cb3b89f",
      "text": "LLM Fundamentals",
      "hash": "a27078bfc6b5fd60b2c2ea51e3db5de7f1f14bf68278506ea5f18e4af3301a43"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d639eb1013f15e660e4ff260e847721825b38729f7fce649a4ceecd37b60e90",
      "text": "AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "29a768799acab15b5a0ee28f241b6e057d0b5ff706c70c3edf7f24676f3d77a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "1df3cad63aa29a311722e0b2751c9600ba3fa61bff875217466b2df078095b7b",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "350458f23963e007fb4a26dba07fd33f7636c260ee53183665aa1601807669ec",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "b02d70cedb9b1e388d5817ff10a1270803f058729f02526a6726e88c03d93249",
      "text": "Free",
      "hash": "f411a1fb62758b4c54690d0a702b4955b54dd22115416fa7b1ce51b4a084818d"
    },
    {
      "id": "883134c24564ae49f9a65076cf3c4433a28d102206facdd256197c9e4effa19d",
      "text": "Series · 25 lessons",
      "hash": "84526feb65825191bb41527ab48bc8c11217abdff4ba52c1dd50387ed22b85fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "7992b91966b8d6fdcb63da26ff235c342ab1a3eee5544318323bbb1799525597",
      "text": "AI Skills for Real Engineers",
      "hash": "8080f99f294dba13aacef7c83da5b81be9e5fc7576a838d3a6c6e2786d1035b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6ace89b495326b3d7d9405db2b4a71bf38fc63e7ca46d57c78ddf35a70b3a00",
      "text": "A practical skill system for engineers who want to use AI without giving up their standards.",
      "hash": "a827ebc64bb5d1abf029a637befc55e88c4701964856e50f279b9870c0e555ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "94c0f138c131cc00237bed2d617a71a95d8162a2fa10213ec19ec3f8314fe73a",
      "text": "Start lesson 1",
      "hash": "4807b65f9294479053540a531b017e8fc8e9abafa633eff06fc9e6f29557bf05"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5fa65e74f840b2b8245f62c01a6b1a0cdbbf70acb939c1974ca7a827fb8cfee",
      "text": "Code",
      "hash": "340f463033e0fd5ddeabb922df4d4f1b5747494d0f5ed9894f13b6e13ca831f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6d88cb5facc6ccfced7cbeb4f51b5a689789655e20140ae16688b0a76458c66",
      "text": "Share",
      "hash": "29887a5ff9846ccc23327565a07e17fa6dcaea6211f1898ae825f84ae38f4223"
    },
    {
      "id": "9752222305fb66a8a0e274bd4ad25cf58699108ed72008f418b28f561a244f1f",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "0bf6967b95fb1bcb2449344ed28b2599946b8e4f27c35ca5af3b606bea1fd8bf",
      "text": "These are the agent skills I lean on every day. They live in my",
      "hash": "a7d2ac249efc2d0810af3f2d1e4bc7e16221b91bb001680eeda486abfe01bb3f"
    },
    {
      "id": "dadb3be2bb3c8ad8d7bccd21eaffe4fe130bcf2e9f74fff89f40a641df6d4aef",
      "text": "directory and ship as a public repo so anyone can install them, fork them, or open a PR with their own.",
      "hash": "a78527424b3d7df51b13a52cef8b29557453667a1cf208a293ce03c714ae02d6"
    },
    {
      "id": "14a85220c93db0eb469e1c6c882acf7504db3847059443222818bd0295e3e33d",
      "text": "What's a skill?",
      "hash": "ffec7e6739cac0639cf59b779b44fb256d3c3cfdfa618706f9699832545c8986"
    },
    {
      "id": "cc565a1c2455da1fdcaae302923410ca02cbba0f25ab38122bed4119e732e031",
      "text": "A skill is a focused, repeatable workflow an agent can run. It bundles a clear instruction set, the inputs it needs, and the outputs you should expect. Skills live as small markdown files that any Claude-compatible agent picks up.",
      "hash": "15ce145b005a9873c2299e239707ddeb3a56c368d8da7d902e9b8e1a6837641a"
    },
    {
      "id": "958aaa0a0245414549fdaf8c608e19b93404683e4f49cf949ef1067931649351",
      "text": "The point isn't to wrap the agent in scaffolding. It's to write down the exact moves I'd make for a given problem so the agent runs them the same way I would, every time.",
      "hash": "e32812393a1f72bc78015f7fdb233b5ce68deb5f43d51385cac7ef016165913c"
    },
    {
      "id": "caa753b88baea887218c28f7d4e0fd3425d9075a2f6da6088a08338e75e1388f",
      "text": "Install",
      "hash": "569ca49f4aaf7846e952c1d4aeca72febd0b79fa1c4f9db08fd3127551218572"
    },
    {
      "id": "7c9dbd6d3bebc62dbec956d8f7a4b2a3c0828e20cad4324641a3c3dfe191ec01",
      "text": "One command pulls the whole catalog into your global skills directory:",
      "hash": "698a7e31d2556525e97b20401e01fb24f434e5773a9f1b67c4eb380addf6b15e"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5a680bf12834e56cb0aee9395b09370a35af805955a1d13ec39fe3c8b6669be",
      "text": "Drop",
      "hash": "c8af9ae37a48273f981bc82af63517e3a2195c4076360e73546c306a044dd38b"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a79e3bdf8daa2f32c855760060f6cda883378f9c84fdc8f6e648486fc208b59",
      "text": "to install into the current project only. Once installed, any agent that reads",
      "hash": "a63e231340f23ad9a346abbc4f8a4efb1c0a63534cfb8a5218ca323f82e34864"
    },
    {
      "id": "518073d5312205c5896645a4cc92956e4c665c1951fbc0fe03fdc17b936237ca",
      "text": "(Claude Code is the obvious one) can pick a skill from the catalog and run it.",
      "hash": "2b39fe593430a2696c7c2d0c1a3c1f9a13d70fcd6b7baa0eaa859687b4c04510"
    },
    {
      "id": "e66b91959baaa57c4c4999e5a16f58678e3d9beea72615df4af22be49279a439",
      "text": "You can also install individual skills if you don't want the whole set. Browse the source for slugs:",
      "hash": "b2db13ee0c77ca06545d8d77f510088fc0d1ca78492149048896f2217b5d12e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b214476f94131ad93f138af9970536e09a39480c466a14f22ca43cbe0fb868a8",
      "text": "github.com/mattpocock/skills",
      "hash": "ec486835e7090c2af80fe3705ccb0ab885ae215da398e7b733a0ecc044b16416"
    },
    {
      "id": "382c4393206b37fccf52894ffc4f2e8d969912ce8b2796cad0db3c73d05b0fc8",
      "text": "How I use them",
      "hash": "fa51a89400e3c3f7b956bc30eb80cfa981ab461b880e382767f9a285c0e498d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "858662f4751779e275a09941f7e403bfa3f3cb1ae5e5a73b2960eddb58af6324",
      "text": "Each skill below is a workflow I reach for in a specific moment: a vague spec to interrogate, a domain to model, a PRD to write, a backlog to break down, a feature to test-drive. They aren't \"AI productivity hacks.\" They're how I keep my taste and standards intact while the agent does the work.",
      "hash": "6f59c61f3e07da3b57c3b3d6393c4b44462d9c0c50303ea18a3161c913f49705"
    },
    {
      "id": "72a8cbc0211d86a95e136de4b107eb7938e42b96534409c7fcb7dd16e8bfe9fc",
      "text": "The catalog lives at",
      "hash": "8124801a585203de973580698ed58152b7347dd4399aa29edf2dcd5ab9fadf4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "974959f7ab222e07f4e5e9ecf261b8032bbe5e42833df26e3c6adb0a37908dda",
      "text": ". If you've shaped a skill that's earned its place in your workflow, share it.",
      "hash": "a815bd6b72a7076862680e11a45ba60518e5b4194ef1aa9d53903387109c98ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "0f99f3f23ba4b70109fa7bbc4a535e342021d50d603372aed1686c49619e66f5",
      "text": ", in order",
      "hash": "68cba9003488304327954a8e8befa73118d6753600a5c8ba21d2b99194e0ee1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "00b5f9256a935fd1b10f6e503093d6a81f20a9c74e9b38973cd65af4ebe8d74b",
      "text": "Lesson",
      "hash": "6e2b26d9de4033b952bd242f69b798420ee887151b937f394efc23252c78af74"
    },
    {
      "id": "faabfc96609557f14865b27466ecab43f0593a7693ea41848d9094c5d413b28b",
      "text": "The /setup-matt-pocock-skills Skill",
      "hash": "0674a6df3e473a2f50336ebb738940e032a1a9c5a21617f3a639eccd99c69b49"
    },
    {
      "id": "35ca65e01c6465d4175057ddaa449ee6c1ee3e9214fed1ee02af901c0638558c",
      "text": "Set up one repo so the other skills know how it works.",
      "hash": "43e7aab494cb34b6e9f7a6b281e62e52bf5898d82737b0520106430ccdc8a78e"
    },
    {
      "id": "5db2e98dad7de3c1533907342715f3744bb450d033781c6b4dc006c82bd14f09",
      "text": "The /ask-matt Skill",
      "hash": "e33293398b90952072fe7083e0cff6ee94d84e49d6ed9c02486551ec483ab2a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "3394fe68bddddd73dd89c2aed78dc3675ea2b67de46a756e3a4c387f359dbb12",
      "text": "Find out which skill to use for the situation you are in.",
      "hash": "e7a2a8ffa79450713b534c7006b5b5a83146beb7b5ca92b0e9f5274bc3acae66"
    },
    {
      "id": "beb3ac04baa9141b46c3b9bc6c381ce816fda393dbd8a6fe9031fccb6d4502e8",
      "text": "The /grill-with-docs Skill",
      "hash": "5d7a7a42b472b35c9a5e2adae6230bf8e98d261994d05596e68436cd90d8e6ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "9377d124750af73be57ffe85b6217dd632a3395b46bbb3a99490c0c5f2fa10c6",
      "text": "Get interviewed about a plan, and record the decisions.",
      "hash": "e0613e7faf7d5debd6ba99e4d64d86953a6440666da603540e579ed0d5ba6e4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "b908aff8b72198283679bcda05917326f1b10779421cb0b0c3f00d864455d32d",
      "text": "The /to-spec Skill",
      "hash": "a23abd13c89fe79ac0e3626d5d4c722e63235829c4cf6f85d3d4d28039733e86"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec49d5c5d779c3b2dab380c62d1c27847c97c7099c59265fb60af385454c9212",
      "text": "Turn an agreed conversation into a written spec.",
      "hash": "91e6f3a80003384410be4fb29eed873433a2671fa358ddc13d9306be7fbc89df"
    },
    {
      "id": "868fd333837a90194fa8825debd49d2700a07000d0b9e297ddcbd54ed6673e52",
      "text": "The /to-tickets Skill",
      "hash": "edb2e623d3d628ae29e30650179052886b0583e7c6d64c61f4833a0555f5ffb9"
    },
    {
      "id": "29f804437a7302eda28065501951ed172d6c4d8f593705c173f89e623611dbbf",
      "text": "Split a spec into small tickets an agent can build.",
      "hash": "2f7eb91d6e60d230c1053c9c1c182268d8c19bf636462ec19f83fcf5389f31e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bd0dd850537d1a3f727f74b1181362ad0c1b72abae8a0baf829bb5ac234a486a",
      "text": "The /implement Skill",
      "hash": "f9c16f5a43a4bc3ee3005e2fe35c9f995067f243d46c0e304c68ca35fc366358"
    },
    {
      "id": "7616e641b05a537217961dfead3ac86896d148703c22ade7967782fe3b1be7fc",
      "text": "Build a finished spec into code, test-first.",
      "hash": "17c81dd1b6d0fe3f9916834f8da1797bc90e00e8c13a04c5e5ea075df068295e"
    },
    {
      "id": "a9cee77b3b7f1d469312613e990f26706fd818a19081db708efc21a87a173e0a",
      "text": "The /code-review Skill",
      "hash": "828cf257382b4e1a77ee8dbdd85ef159141d8c34e4942831831d4f70f5ee84e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "4ba83bb15da8498087d536aff8fc52ba19260ee2996fe33596dd323c545d94df",
      "text": "Review a diff against your standards and against the spec.",
      "hash": "989b04edac7564ca86e6e4b8c4dc81b9c0f10293b9dca4ad2269fc3a027f2414"
    },
    {
      "id": "3d4bb21a8b9aa3a7d6329464a2e3c4c5fec8ac092ca7305f03b2e536a867233f",
      "text": "The /wayfinder Skill",
      "hash": "ad5c81cc0127099d818f2a0d357323e62abb1458a56b2b704db6d50303313c48"
    },
    {
      "id": "6170db2af31d51e885257877869da0f6974bd20969d604a3211098461eaf6b46",
      "text": "Chart a large effort as a map of decisions, and settle them.",
      "hash": "9b26c847f92a26cc850b923ad33198bed591f0d2303cc2aa584c46f35b0b2b73"
    },
    {
      "id": "79cc87015adf73cdfd973c35722f30e02d94e2886310ff23432661cd9ec7b396",
      "text": "The /prototype Skill",
      "hash": "0704c2a7f3f21081c77a25eda1e8be09a3e7cf6c6bcd5111b05f143302886d01"
    },
    {
      "id": "7eb9b48b444c5e478ec968c583ec0578c850bbd5ef9b241620bcb073643f3ca7",
      "text": "Answer a design question with code you then delete.",
      "hash": "f58ced05a5a15609081a9a33dea4bd0f49667c79024c4c6276ca5fbb7755dac8"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae332e702f73236c5a6b7a3a01391577c4359f7c34e630e1013d061d6402030d",
      "text": "The /research Skill",
      "hash": "d44fca1fd1a3bf52e4677b6e3793c990ea7f8b12508f0fe03d7bc328c60ad562"
    },
    {
      "id": "efeed97fe9eead74ef0660baec0414c6c7ee10f9da1cb8fc866d079dd96442b5",
      "text": "Get a cited answer, read from primary sources.",
      "hash": "8729edd445e908272061a117df0331369ced9bb9953c13740aac5c062166b2d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad73623be49b30b438ea7608493781e06f495c4614ac801c47c92c6a70545418",
      "text": "The /improve-codebase-architecture Skill",
      "hash": "1d2feca177f8d2a2229e95a3f013777630bd379b24ca132a89d1c87623d2d722"
    },
    {
      "id": "9453c597ef924757d115bdf7a9ac0c1e46fe8a68c5f1273eaf3dc6c624d2be01",
      "text": "Find the modules worth refactoring, as a visual report.",
      "hash": "e68f7f37b834194faceb91a5decd54e183228e21ce907c7fc6f4f1957d2b0885"
    },
    {
      "id": "047c113302d5a2a9fd986c35c197414fe424d6c46bacec5c81c410b518711da3",
      "text": "The /diagnosing-bugs Skill",
      "hash": "82d22e5c3f7a145e0c607c7003a935a563d1e107a030000f3aa33cbcb8f1f676"
    },
    {
      "id": "cefd5795e67f66f4894f56f8c5eb65af3d1377fbc61b950963c3c6d53ee3a477",
      "text": "Diagnose a hard bug, starting from a repro that fails.",
      "hash": "06a7fabf29ccfc91b67039ea29118eb89146a7a5ff46a87b6c1a85510c7c2eae"
    },
    {
      "id": "a741a74466afcbbb44cc7387fbf2470dde84b3360b9e9801098283eb4fe2e22c",
      "text": "The /resolving-merge-conflicts Skill",
      "hash": "503c1d265cd640ce24d1252efc32c21add9fc91cd0c40a7ecf7af547a1f28fd0"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7cbd68da265a347af31262fffd64341dc1fd3373a9ff04b59743b40635f8526",
      "text": "Finish a merge or rebase conflict, hunk by hunk.",
      "hash": "f0a2531ad701741352b3d7c996df8522dfae50698ebeff40d771a35d0f768fec"
    },
    {
      "id": "bbeb0ae2c5cfbabdff00c7dd02630afb37e1d6eb49ef98f40b57d81ad214c02f",
      "text": "The /triage Skill",
      "hash": "28ca8c73ddb7e7f15619f62dd65f987942e6e4a625b9bcc743e938d3322893ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb4dd8fc986a5c93910de9c89532ecb683f1ba5da81486c2eb3a6185e464240c",
      "text": "Sort raw issues into work someone can pick up.",
      "hash": "e6bd65a2d22d54b2d388915bd6cb13c5b9ec92ceb47864c56f2d77d30ee3e067"
    },
    {
      "id": "860ab9d71b5c6f07d28aab71530394653b11576de59a55c0cbb8da4301c56aa4",
      "text": "The /wizard Skill",
      "hash": "dc2a9dfb2e7aafb5b920a374d3edfadca9df74126313b2f8bbd9533e45a3805a"
    },
    {
      "id": "e62f9424c6a6eaddc1262f57c3462d1f9f908f1360ed39acf0c12e929ed192d8",
      "text": "Generate a script that walks a human through setup.",
